await page('/proposaldesk/','ProposalDesk — Build. Fix. De-risk.','Expert bid preparation and assurance for consultants, NGOs, research firms and proposal teams.',`<section class="pd-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="pd-lockup">ProposalDesk<span>.</span><span class="mono">A PRODUCT BY SYFUL HOQUE</span></div><div class="pd-hero-grid"><div>${kicker('BUILD. FIX. DE-RISK. SUBMIT.')}<h1>A stronger bid.<br><em>A clearer case.</em></h1><p>Expert writing and submission assurance for donor bids, EOIs, RFPs and tenders. Bring a brief, an active draft or a submission under pressure.</p><div class="hero-actions">${link('#packs','Find your starting point','button pd-button')}${link('/work-with-me/?service=ProposalDesk','Discuss your bid','text-link light-link')}</div></div><div class="pd-assurance"><span class="mono">THE SUBMISSION LOGIC</span><ol><li><span>01</span><strong>Compliant</strong><p>Requirements accounted for.</p></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Coherent</strong><p>Method, team and budget aligned.</p></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Credible</strong><p>Claims supported by evidence.</p></li></ol><div class="pd-stamp">EXPERT JUDGEMENT. PRACTICAL FIXES.</div></div></div><div class="pd-policy mono"><span>ASSURANCE + BUILD TRACKS</span><span>6 ENGAGEMENTS / WEEK — OPERATING CAP</span><span>FEES AGREED BEFORE WORK BEGINS</span></div></div></section><section id="packs" class="section wrap"><div class="section-top"><div>${kicker('CHOOSE YOUR STARTING POINT')}<h2>Right support.<br><em>Right moment.</em></h2></div><p class="section-aside">Final scope, fee and turnaround depend on your tender, document volume and deadline.</p></div><div class="pack-grid">${packs.map(([name,tag,time,...list],i)=>`<article class="pack${i===1?' pack-featured':''}"><span class="mono">${i===1?'CORE SERVICE':'0'+(i+1)+' / '+(i===3?'BUILD':'ASSURANCE')}</span><h3>${name}</h3><p>${tag}</p><ul>${list.map(l=>`<li>${l}</li>`).join('')}</ul><span class="pack-time mono">${time}</span>${link('/work-with-me/?service='+encodeURIComponent(name),'Discuss this scope','button'+(i===1?' pd-button':''))}</article>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="section wrap pd-process"><div>${kicker('A CLEAR WORKING PROCESS')}<h2>From brief<br><em>to final check.</em></h2></div><ol>${[['Share the tender','Send the ToR, submission deadline and current stage.'],['Agree the scope','Confirm priorities, deliverables, fee and turnaround.'],['Build or strengthen','Work through the argument, documentation and practical fixes.'],['Run the assurance pass','Check consistency and readiness against the agreed scope.']].map(([h,p],i)=>`<li><span class="mono">0${i+1}</span><div><h3>${h}</h3><p>${p}</p></div></li>`).join('')}</ol></section><section class="section wrap faq-section"><h2>Before we begin.</h2><div>${[['Can you work with an existing draft?','Yes. The Bid Fix Pack and Submission Assurance tracks are designed around active drafts. The initial review establishes what can be improved within the deadline.'],['Can you write from the beginning?','The Build track covers proposal writing or substantial rewriting, with the scope agreed against the actual tender and available evidence.'],['Is a successful award guaranteed?','No. ProposalDesk supports the quality, coherence and readiness of the submission. The procuring organisation makes the award decision.'],['How do I share documents?','Start with a short brief. Document-sharing arrangements are agreed directly; this website does not collect uploads.'],['How quickly will you reply?','The stated service commitment is a reply within 12 working hours. Turnaround begins after scope, inputs and availability are agreed.']].map(([q,a])=>`<details><summary>${q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>${a}</p></details>`).join('')}</div></section>${cta('Make the submission count.','Share the tender, the stage you are at and the deadline.')}`);
